Package: PASSAGE
Type: Package
Title: Pathway-Level Spatial Association Testing
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Diptavo", "Dutta", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "dutta.diptavo@gmail.com")
  )
Author: Diptavo Dutta
Maintainer: Diptavo Dutta <dutta.diptavo@gmail.com>
Description: Tests whether predefined gene sets show spatially varying
    expression after adjustment for measured covariates and background spatial
    structure. Implements sparse spatial factor models, self-contained and
    competitive pathway tests, pathway-level spatial effect-size and coherence
    metrics, and stability-based driver-gene analyses.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    Matrix,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    CompQuadForm,
    corpcor,
    fastICA,
    FNN,
    irlba,
    MASS,
    RSpectra,
    testthat,
    TMB
URL: https://github.com/diptavo/PASSAGE
BugReports: https://github.com/diptavo/PASSAGE/issues
